  "title": "BEUTEA",
  "text": "BEUTEA, - a modern tea beverage brand using \"Freshly Brewed Chinese Tea\" (a combination of ancient Chinese and modern tea beverage). Beutea practices the four ancient tea ceremony skills \"moisten\", \"soak\", \"boil\", and \"brew\" using extract from the finest hand-picked tea leaves originating from tea mountains of Yunnan and Wuyi in China as the base of their beverages. It is then blended with modern flavours such as fresh milk and fresh fruits to brew unique, exquisite, aromatic and delicious fresh tea beverages.\n\n",
